  "Oléron s’est construite entre fortifications, commerce du sel et culture de l’huître. Ses villages et ses chenaux gardent la mémoire d’une île laborieuse, aujourd’hui encore profondément liée aux marées.": "Oléron was built between fortifications, salt trade and oyster cultivation. Its villages and channels preserve the memory of a hard-working island, still today deeply linked to the tides.",
