  "Les premières salines apparaissent au XIVe siècle, puis la sédimentation permet leur extension autour d’Ars et de Loix au XVe siècle.": "The first salt pans appeared in the 14th century, then sedimentation allowed their extension around Ars and Loix in the 15th century.",
